# Legacy Square Scenario

**Status:** Deprecated — not used in the current highway paper matrix.

## Purpose

Dense square topology for early MAC/QoS validation. Same legacy V2X naming as [`veins_inet_highway`](../veins_inet_highway/README).

## Configs

`plain`, `edca_only`, `edca_v2x`, `edca_v2x_be_friendly` (deprecated), `edca_v2x_vo_protect` (deprecated).

## Run

```bash
cd veins/bin && ./veins_launchd -vv
cd veins_qos/simulations/veins_inet_square
./run -u Cmdenv -c edca_v2x
```

